  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the historical persona embodied by the man in the suit",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the man in the suit stepping off the train, who is implicitly framed as 'me' or 'back in my day' persona. The text 'back in my day' creates an anachronistic perspective that invites the viewer to identify with the man as a representative of a past era, thereby projecting the user's own identity onto this historical figure. This projection is reinforced by the meme's format, which uses the man's appearance (plaid suit, cigar, confident posture) to visually embody the nostalgic speaker.",
